<title>UK: London shipsales.</title>
<headline>London shipsales.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Secondhand tonnage brokers reported the sale of the following vessels.</p>
<p>BULKERS - Sarine 2 - (built 1982) 12,330 dwt sold to Chinese buyers for $5.4 million with two years timecharter at $6,500 daily.</p>
<p>SOLD FOR DEMOLITION - New Brooklyn - (built 1973) 229,727 dwt sold to Bangladeshi breakers for $182 per ldt.</p>
</text>
